    <values><field>LongDescription__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">Finds: SBQQ__GeneralSettings__c records where SBQQ__RenewalModel__c is null.
Why it matters: Renewal generation falls back to an unspecified default that may not match your business model — renewal quotes generate with wrong structures, wrong pricing references, or fail entirely.
Suppress a finding: only during a controlled migration between renewal models.
Disable the detector: leave on for any org using CPQ renewals.</value></values>
